// is 0 for an FMAC (one or four) and for an ILW at every p, on both VUs.  For a divide it is
// max(0, L - p - 5) and for an EFU op max(0, L - p - 6), L = 7 (DIV), 13 (RSQRT), 12 (ESQRT), 18
